Extract each codepoint from the UTF-8 string

ForEach Test 1
Extract each codepoint from gus1 using UTF8.ForEach(gus1) - abcde
--------------------------------------------------:------------------------------
  Unicon Code                                     :    Result
--------------------------------------------------:------------------------------
image(s6 := UTF8.New(""))                         : object UTF8____UTF8Object_1211(8)
every s5 := UTF8.ForEach(gus1) do {               : 
# Iteration 1                                     : 
    s5.String()                                   : a
    (s6 := UTF8.Concatenate(s6, s5)).String()     : a
# Iteration 2                                     : 
    s5.String()                                   : b
    (s6 := UTF8.Concatenate(s6, s5)).String()     : ab
# Iteration 3                                     : 
    s5.String()                                   : c
    (s6 := UTF8.Concatenate(s6, s5)).String()     : abc
# Iteration 4                                     : 
    s5.String()                                   : d
    (s6 := UTF8.Concatenate(s6, s5)).String()     : abcd
# Iteration 5                                     : 
    s5.String()                                   : e
    (s6 := UTF8.Concatenate(s6, s5)).String()     : abcde
}                                                 : 
s6.String() === gus1.String()                     :  matches with original
